{"id":"cecotec-nuggets-de-coliflor-en-cecofry","sourceUrl":"https://cecotec.es/recetas/cecofry/nuggets-de-coliflor-en-cecofry","publishedAt":"2025-03-28T13:41:41+01:00","name":{"es":"Nuggets de coliflor","en":"Cauliflower nuggets"},"description":{"es":"","en":""},"appliances":["cecofry"],"course":"snack","tags":["cecofry","snack"],"baseServings":4,"servingsMax":null,"servingsUnit":"comensales","servingsText":"4","minutes":30,"minutesSource":"cecotec","timeBucket":"le30","difficulty":"easy","difficultySource":"cecotec","kcalPerServing":null,"photoUrl":"/ideas/photos/cecotec-nuggets-de-coliflor-en-cecofry.jpg","cookedCount":0,"ingredients":[{"ingredientId":"aceite-de-oliva","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"Aceite de oliva"},{"ingredientId":"sal","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"Sal"},{"ingredientId":"pimienta","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"Pimienta"},{"ingredientId":"ajo-en-polvo","quantity":0.17,"unit":"tbsp","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"½ cucharadita de ajo en polvo"},{"ingredientId":"cebolla-en-polvo","quantity":0.17,"unit":"tbsp","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"½ cucharadita de cebolla en polvo"},{"ingredientId":"huevo","quantity":1,"unit":"ud","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"1 huevo"},{"ingredientId":"cereal-de-maiz","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"Cereales de maíz"},{"ingredientId":"curry","quantity":0.17,"unit":"tbsp","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"½ cucharadita de curry"},{"ingredientId":"curcuma","quantity":0.17,"unit":"tbsp","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"½ cucharadita de cúrcuma"},{"ingredientId":"coliflor-cocida","quantity":275,"unit":"g","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"275 g de coliflor cocida"},{"ingredientId":"patata-cocida","quantity":150,"unit":"g","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"150 g de patata cocida"},{"ingredientId":"almendra-molida","quantity":6,"unit":"tbsp","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"6 cucharadas de almendra molida"}],"steps":[{"text":{"es":"Ponemos en un bol la coliflor, la patata cocida, la cúrcuma, el curry, el ajo y la cebolla en polvo, una pizca de pimienta y otra de sal, machacamos con ayuda de un tenedor.","en":"Put the cauliflower, cooked potato, turmeric, curry, garlic and onion powder, a pinch of pepper and a pinch of salt in a bowl and mash with a fork."}},{"text":{"es":"Añadimos el huevo y la almendra, mezclamos bien.","en":"Add the egg and the almond and mix well."}},{"text":{"es":"Formamos los nuggets de coliflor y los pasamos por copos de maíz machacados.","en":"Shape the cauliflower nuggets and coat them in crushed corn flakes."}},{"text":{"es":"Colocamos los nuggets en la cubeta de la Cecofry con papel de horno, echamos un poco de aceite en spray y programamos 200ºC durante 12 minutos.","en":"Place the nuggets in the Cecofry basket with baking paper, spray on a little oil and set to 200 °C for 12 minutes."},"timerMinutes":12,"temperatureC":200},{"text":{"es":"Les damos la vuelta y programamos 200ºC durante 8 minutos.","en":"Turn them over and set to 200 °C for 8 minutes."},"timerMinutes":8,"temperatureC":200},{"text":{"es":"Servimos con salsa mayo sriracha.","en":"Serve with sriracha mayo sauce."}}]}